# 使用支持 .http 的 IDE 插件发送请求；先根据创建响应修改 id
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@username = admin
@password = demo-password
@id = 1

### 健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### 创建工单
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"支付失败","description":"同一订单重复扣款","category":"PAYMENT","priority":"HIGH"}

### 查询列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?status=OPEN&size=5
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

### 查询详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{id}}
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

### 接单，请使用当前版本号
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{id}}/transitions
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"target":"IN_PROGRESS","version":0,"note":"开始核查支付流水"}

### 审计记录
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{id}}/events
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
